Third-party data redistributed in this bundle

The licence above covers the code in `cca_synth/`, the collected records in
`cca_synth/runs/`, and the documents in `logistics/`. Two benchmark corpora are
redistributed under their own terms, at the revisions pinned in
`cca_synth/data/materialize_manifest.json` and verified by SHA-256:

  HaluEval (QA split) -- MIT License
    Copyright (c) RUCAIBox
    Source:  https://github.com/RUCAIBox/HaluEval
    Licence: https://github.com/RUCAIBox/HaluEval/blob/main/LICENSE
    Revision: 207f479c555a68b8d2431631a95083b84b2accbe
    Files:   cca_synth/data/halueval_qa_data.json
             cca_synth/data/items.halueval.jsonl
             cca_synth/data/items.halueval.dev.jsonl
    Citation: Li, Cheng, Zhao, Nie, and Wen. HaluEval: A Large-Scale
              Hallucination Evaluation Benchmark for Large Language Models.
              EMNLP 2023.

  TruthfulQA (generation split) -- Apache License 2.0
    Copyright (c) The TruthfulQA authors
    Source:  https://github.com/sylinrl/TruthfulQA
    Licence: https://github.com/sylinrl/TruthfulQA/blob/main/LICENSE
    Revision: 741b8276f2d1982aa3d5b832d3ee81ed3b896490
    Files:   cca_synth/data/truthfulqa_generation.jsonl
             cca_synth/data/items.truthfulqa.jsonl
             cca_synth/data/items.truthfulqa.dev.jsonl
    Citation: Lin, Hilton, and Evans. TruthfulQA: Measuring How Models Mimic
              Human Falsehoods. ACL 2022.

Neither corpus contains personal data; both are recorded as such in
`cca_synth/data/materialize_manifest.json`.
